%% C4-Style Context + Containers (simplificado) - StudentsPoint
flowchart TB
    classDef person fill:#d1e9ff,stroke:#1f2937,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.2px
    classDef system fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#111827,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.2px
    classDef container fill:#e2f0cb,stroke:#1f2937,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.2px
    classDef external fill:#fcdabf,stroke:#1f2937,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.2px
    classDef data fill:#c7e3d0,stroke:#1f2937,color:#111827,stroke-width:1.2px

    %% Contexto
    P["Usuarios / Estudiantes<br/>Web + PWA"]:::person
    Adm["Staff / Admin"]:::person

    SP["StudentsPoint<br/>(Sistema principal)"]:::system
    ExtPay["Servicios externos<br/>(ngrok / pasarelas / media)"]:::external

    P -->|Navega / consume API| SP
    Adm -->|Administra| SP
    SP -- HTTPS t?nel --> ExtPay

    %% Contenedores internos del sistema
    subgraph Sistema StudentsPoint
        direction TB
        API["Backend Django + DRF<br/>Servicios: auth, forum, market,<br/>reportes, encuestas, portfolio"]:::container
        Front["Frontend SPA/PWA est?tica<br/>HTML/CSS/JS + manifest + SW"]:::container
        DB["Base de datos<br/>SQLite (dev) / Postgres (prod)"]:::data
        Media["Almacenamiento media<br/>Uploads locales (dev)<br/>S3/Blob (prod)"]:::data
    end

    P --> Front
    Front -->|fetch| API
    Adm -->|dashboards| API
    API --> DB
    API --> Media
    API --> Front

    %% Infra de acceso
    subgraph Acceso y despliegue local
        direction LR
        Ngrok["ngrok t?nel p?blico<br/>https://<id>.ngrok-free.app -> 8000"]:::external
        Run["Servidor Django dev<br/>runserver/gunicorn :8000"]:::container
    end

    Front -. servido por .-> Run
    API -. WSGI/ASGI .-> Run
    Run --> Ngrok
    P -->|HTTPS| Ngrok --> Run
